// GENERATED — do not edit. CMake writes this from tools/control_page.cpp.in, embedding
// tools/control_page.html and tools/control_page.js verbatim (issue #96 item 4).
//
// Why embedded rather than installed as files the daemon reads at runtime: a control page read
// from disk is a path the daemon has to locate on three platforms, that a package can fail to
// install, and that anything with write access to the install tree could replace with script the
// browser would then run as same-origin. Compiled in, the page cannot be any of those.
